+          "quote": "If $f:U\\to\\mathbb R^n$ is totally differentiable at $a$, then $D_vf(a)$ exists for every $v\\in\\mathbb R^m$ and equals $Df(a)v$. In particular $\\partial_jf(a)=Df(a)e_j$, and the matrix of $Df(a)$ is $Jf(a)$.",
