-          "claim": "Along the exact solution, the chain rule [F5] gives $y''(s)=f_t(s,y(s))+D_yf(s,y(s))f(s,y(s))$. The bound in the Statement and [F4], applied to the curve $y'$ on $[t,t+h]$, therefore give $\\|y(t+h)-y(t)-hf(t,y(t))\\|_2\\le M_1h^2/2$.",
